  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (Sum of the digits of the first number)³ = second number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor 23 : 125\n\n⇒ (2 + 3)³\n\n⇒ 5³ = 125\n\nSimilarly, for 31 : ?\n\n⇒ (3 + 1)³\n\n⇒ 4³ = 64\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
